flowchart TB
 Users[Web / Field Users] --> Edge[API Gateway / BFF]
 Edge --> IAM[Identity + Authorization]
 Edge --> Platform[Platform Services: Tenant / Config / Audit / Workflow / Files / Search]
 Edge --> Domain[Domain Modules: Estimating / Project / CRM / Workforce / Fleet / Procurement / Schedule / Commercial / HSE / Docs / GIS]
 Domain --> Engines[Construction Engines: Cost / Production / Haul / Regional / Pricing / Takeoff]
 Domain --> AI[AI Orchestrator + Plan Intelligence + Evaluation]
 Domain --> Int[Integration Hub + Event Bus]
 Platform --> Data[(Canonical Transaction Data)]
 Domain --> Data
 AI --> Obj[(Object / Drawing Evidence)]
 Int --> External[External Systems]
 Data --> Analytics[Analytics Pipeline]
 Edge --> Obs[Observability]
 Platform --> Obs
 Domain --> Obs
 AI --> Obs
